@startuml "Student News Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam sequenceMessageSize 22
actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "NewsController" as NC
participant "NewsService" as NS
participant "TLU Website" as TLU
participant "Image Proxy" as Proxy
database "Cache" as Cache

Student -> FE: Xem danh sách tin TLU
FE -> NC: GET /api/news
NC -> NS: getNews()
alt Cache còn hạn
	NS -> Cache: Read cached news
	Cache --> NS: data
else Cache hết hạn
	NS -> TLU: GET các trang tin
	TLU --> NS: HTML
	NS -> NS: Cào & trích xuất tin
	NS -> Cache: Save cached news
end
NS --> NC: data
NC --> FE: 200 OK

FE -> Proxy: GET /api/news/image-proxy?url=...
Proxy -> TLU: GET image (Referer TLU)
TLU --> Proxy: image bytes
Proxy --> FE: image

Student -> FE: Xem chi tiết tin
FE -> FE: Hiển thị chi tiết từ dữ liệu đã tải
@enduml
